CiukiOS: bounded CSS Color 4 RGB/alpha hex parsing. Specification:
https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#rgb-functions
https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#hex-notation

rgb/rgba accept modern space/slash and legacy comma grammar, fractional
channels, percentage alpha and non-interpolated none. Clamp before scaling;
quantize modern syntax to nearest 8-bit channels (ties up), retaining
legacy comma truncation for existing golden compatibility. Keep bare-hex
quirks at 3/6 digits. No allocations, new retained state or budget changes.
Host checks: tests/host/netsurf/test_modern.py.

